  fullText: Entry 1\n\nWe have decided to denominate the foreign object simply as
    the\n"Visitor". It seems to possess an electronic interior, covered by an\nextremely
    resistant metallic exterior. It is outputting all sorts of\nunknown signals,
    and I am starting to worry that our technology might\nnot be advanced enough
    to comprehend it. Others are highly skeptical\nabout its origins, thinking it
    might be someone playing a joke on us,\nbut I am convinced such complexity can
    not be achieved on Proima.\nWhat an incredible discovery!
